{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_2c4b2a57-b949-99e0-b611-a98240d63ed0","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"qwen3.5-122b-a10b","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Первая открытая задача L-04 требует изменить импорты на формат модулями целиком, так как это правка кода по правилам проекта — буду выполнять сам без субагента.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":14231,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cef1a43a-0d88-4600-8599-b2f60b034998","uuid":"271e2c66-9bb4-431b-a3b5-b6d892e88cad","timestamp":"2026-10-24T23:25:06.848Z","thinking_duration_ms":429,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_2c4b2a57-b949-99e0-b611-a98240d63ed0","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"qwen3.5-122b-a10b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Первая открытая задача — **L-04. Импорты из app — модулями целиком**. Профиль: фича/правка кода по `CLAUDE.md` — делаю сам.\n\n"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":14231,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cef1a43a-0d88-4600-8599-b2f60b034998","uuid":"3caade83-707c-4835-ac8b-229ec82e4888","timestamp":"2026-10-24T23:25:07.281Z"}
